usb (node-usb)
https://github.com/node-usb/node-usb
Copyright (c) 2012 Nonolith Labs, LLC
Licensed under the MIT License (node_modules/usb/LICENSE).

Used only on the Node side (lib/jtag/transport-node.ts: the MCP `program` tool's
"native-ts" method, the `npm run jtag` harness, and the local server's USB
device listing). It is installed from npm as a dependency and is not bundled
into the browser app.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libusb
https://github.com/libusb/libusb
Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
(node_modules/usb/libusb/COPYING).

Ships inside the `usb` package's native Node addon, which Node loads at run
time; Node side only. hw-studio does not modify or vendor libusb. Its source
comes with the `usb` package (node_modules/usb/libusb), and the addon can be
rebuilt from it with node-gyp, so it can be replaced with a modified libusb.
The browser app uses Chrome's WebUSB and contains no libusb.

