The OV2640 and OV5640 register tables in blocks/ov_sccb_init/data/*.hex are
generated from sensors/private_include/ov2640_settings.h and
ov5640_settings.h (and the init and window sequences in sensors/ov2640.c and
ov5640.c) of this project. Only register addresses and values were taken, in
a new file format, with the sequence reassembled for 320x240 / 640x480 RGB565
and Y8 output.

